Third-Party Data Attribution Notice:
BearingSense is designed to ingest publicly available experimental bearing vibration
measurements from the Case Western Reserve University (CWRU) Bearing Data Center
(https://engineering.case.edu/bearingdatacenter/welcome), Principal Investigator:
Prof. Kenneth A. Loparo. Raw CWRU `.mat` files are not redistributed in this
repository; users should obtain them directly from the official CWRU Bearing Data
Center and cite the source in accordance with academic standards.
